            <ArticleTitle>Agenesis of the posterolateral bundle of anterior cruciate ligament.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>596-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00167-012-1962-1</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The objective of this article is to report an anterior cruciate ligament variation that has not been previously described, in which the posterolateral bundle of anterior cruciate ligament is congenitally not developed. The clinical picture and the magnetic resonance images are presented, and the arthroscopic appearance is described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
